{%- comment -%}
  Benefit checklist card (paste into a "Custom Liquid" section or block).
  Light-green card, one row per benefit: green check-square icon, bold lead, " - ", description.
  Measured from the reference screenshot: card #f6fdfa, text #0c482b, icon #34a23b, no border, 2 px radius,
  18 px text at line-height 1.33, 1 em between rows, 20 px icon centred on the row.
  Edit the four <li> rows below; the font family is inherited from the theme.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
